   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "One point of overlap, and it's the disqualifying one. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: Two different pieces here, matched in every other way. The first one's cut is completely me.",
   "images": [
