    "brown/polka_dot_t_shirt.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 7,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:17",
   "text": "Found the overlap — that color is yours.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 8,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:10",
   "text": "Big closet purge tonight. The keep pile and the donate pile are both growing.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 9,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:11",
   "text": "Brutal honesty hour. What's surviving?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 10,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:12",
   "text": "All two are the same cut and nothing else matches. That cut is the one I stay away from.",
   "images": [
    "yellow/solid_tank_top.jpg",
    "red/polka_dot_tank_top.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 11,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:13",
   "text": "One shared cut, and it's the disqualifying one. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 12,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:14",
   "text": "Next out of the pile: This one, though: that cut is the one cut that never works on me.",
